    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακατέχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold fast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Apollon.Cit.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Anat.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; <i>hold</i> in the mouth, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.
			</span></i>
			
				Tarent.
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.958
			</span></i>; of splinters of bone, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.14
			</span></i>; <i>keep in check,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.51.2
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hold in possession,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				70.3
			</span></i>; <i>inhabit,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				17.5
			</span></i>; <i>occupy, hold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ju.</u>
				4.7(6)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενικοῖς ὅπλοις τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπαρχείαν,</span>
			= Lat. <i>obtinere provinciam</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				441.108
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερωσύνην</span> Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				14.10.4
			</span></i>: of the head of a school, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολὴν] δυ᾽ ἔτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
					p.100M.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				p.108M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>keep on foot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					15.82
				</span></i>
			.</div>
